<title>UK: Nuremberg Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark Nov 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Nuremberg Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark Nov 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Vereinsbank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NUREMBERG HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    30.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.25     PAY DATE   *22.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     LISTING    MUNICH    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	*PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    SIX	 SELL CONC  19	  PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
